  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "3.10.6-beta added `VRCAvatarDescriptor.IsBasicFaceTrackingKey` to determine if a `FaceTrackingKey` is available without `useAllTrackingKeys`.\n\nHowever, `IsBasicFaceTrackingKey` takes int instead of `FaceTrackingKey`.\n\nSince C# does not implicitly cast enum to int, callers working with `FaceTrackingKey` must manually cast `FaceTrackingKey` to int, and an int parameter is not a self-documenting signature.\n\nTherefore, I think `VRCAvatarDescriptor.IsBasicFaceTrackingKey` should accept `VRCAvatarDescriptor.FaceTrackingKey`.",
